  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Afghan Refugees to Launch a Catering Business</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks $5,000 to help a 27-member family of Afghan refugees in Maryland start a business selling homemade Afghan food. Back in Kabul, the female family-members worked alongside the men as interpreters, photojournalists, teachers, and engineers. One owned an HVAC business. Another was a professional boxer. Then came Taliban rule. The women became targets and were among the last to be evacuated. Your donations will provide the start-up capital for their new life in the US!</narrative>
  </description>
